flowchart TD
    Paul["You / Chief of staff"] -->|authorize| Control["Coordinator + SQLite · leases, budgets, pinned inputs"]
    Control --> Plan["Discovery + planning · contracts and work graph"]
    Plan --> A["Delivery team A"]
    Plan --> B["Delivery team B"]
    A --> Check["Integrate + test · isolated code execution"]
    B --> Check
    Check --> Verify["Independent acceptance"]
    Verify -->|repair| Plan
    Verify --> Review["Review packet"]
    Review -->|approve / revise / reject| Paul
    Verify --> Memory["Sourced memory + outcomes"]
    Memory -. context .-> Plan
    Memory --> Candidate["Improvement candidate"]
    Candidate --> Gate["Frozen evaluation gate"]
    Gate --> Trial["Bounded trial + review"]
    Trial -->|retain or roll back| Release["Versioned definitions"]
    Release --> Control
